'''Ep. 3: Lady of Darkness''' (第3話 黒き貴婦人, ''Daisanwa Kuroki Kifujin'', '''Episode 3 The Dark Lady''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

==Overview==
Ep. 3: Lady of Darkness contains a total of 10 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards and gauntlet progress reset with every appearance of the event.

